[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 5581.27, "timestamp": "01:33:01", "text": "好的。 我的天哪，太好了。 好的。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 5583.51, "timestamp": "01:33:03", "text": "好的。 好的。 好的。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 5591.669, "timestamp": "01:33:11", "text": "所以，拥有这样一个特定于命令的命令"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 5594.31, "timestamp": "01:33:14", "text": "计数器"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 5600.31, "timestamp": "01:33:20", "text": "实际上可以帮助我处理我的工作。   是的"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 5602.47, "timestamp": "01:33:22", "text": "。 所以按钮会"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 5605.91, "timestamp": "01:33:25", "text": "每隔 3 秒或 5 秒运行一次，或者哪怕是几分"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 5610.79, "timestamp": "01:33:30", "text": "之一秒，不管怎样，秒。嗯，是的，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 5614.07, "timestamp": "01:33:34", "text": "如果它还没有发送到"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 5617.27, "timestamp": "01:33:37", "text": "聊天消息，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 5620.55, "timestamp": "01:33:40", "text": "它就会发送；如果它已经发送过，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 5623.59, "timestamp": "01:33:43", "text": "它就已经被记录下来了，对，已经在"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 5627.11, "timestamp": "01:33:47", "text": "这里记录了，对，它"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 5630.39, "timestamp": "01:33:50", "text": "之前已经发送过。是的，如果已经"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 5634.149, "timestamp": "01:33:54", "text": "发送过不止一次，那么"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 5636.95, "timestamp": "01:33:56", "text": "它就不会再发送了"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 5638.47, "timestamp": "01:33:58", "text": "。"}]